\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces In this figure presents the performance for the diffetent models after running the pipeline over different sample sizes. The left plot displays the accuracy score and the right plot shos the F1-score. We can see that Logistic Regression is performing the worst, and the KNN and RDA is almost similar in their performance over different sample sizes.}}{5}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
